  "body": "Set on a generous 765 sqm (approx.) section with a substantial 307sqm (approx.) floor area, the home offers 5 well-sized bedrooms and 4 family bathrooms, including 3 ensuites. This impressive modern residence delivers exceptional space, thoughtful design, and outstanding versatility, perfectly suited for large or extended families. \r\n\r\nUpstairs forms the heart of the home, where a spacious and light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area creates a welcoming hub for everyday living and entertaining. The beautifully finished dark-toned kitchen, combining style and functionality, showcases a spacious island bench, quality appliances, and excellent storage. It is complemented by a fully equipped scullery, providing additional preparation space and keeping the main kitchen clean and organised. An additional lounge, enhanced by a striking raked ceiling, offers a light-filled and spacious retreat. This beautifully proportioned space creates a sense of openness and comfort, providing the perfect setting for relaxed family living, quiet downtime, or an alternative entertaining area.\r\n\r\nSliding doors lead to a sun-drenched balcony capturing an elevated outlook-an idyllic setting for your morning coffee or evening unwind. The living space further extends to a private deck, seamlessly blending indoor comfort with effortless outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation on this level is thoughtfully arranged for comfort and privacy. The master bedroom offers a peaceful escape with its own walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while two additional bedrooms are serviced by a modern family bathroom. Another additional bedroom also features its own ensuite, offering excellent separation and convenience for family members or guests.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor adds further flexibility, featuring one bedroom with its own private ensuite, ideal for extended family, guests, or independent living arrangements. A double internal-access garage provides secure parking and everyday convenience, with ample space for storage.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features Include:\r\nUnderfloor heating in bathrooms\r\nCentral air-conditioning\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Millwater's most desirable locations, this property provides easy access to top-rated schools, lush parks, golden beaches, boutique shopping, and convenient transport links. It's a lifestyle address designed for families who value quality, space, and connection.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a spacious and versatile family home in a prime location.\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing.",
